    "embedded-library"
  ],
  "mach:intendedUse": "A research pipeline for extracting body-composition metrics from CT; outputs (including bone mineral density Z/T-scores) are explicitly NOT FDA cleared and not for clinical decision-making without validation.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-11-22",
  "schema:comment": "README labels the BMD pipeline output 'NOT FDA cleared'. Installed from source (pip install -e .), not currently on PyPI.",
